rfaceReading":{"term":"영화가","audio":"/audio/71d36dbc5cb7f78071bd.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔다는데","meaning":"上市，出品","explanation":"나오다：上市，出品；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다는데：引用或转述内容，交代后文所需的背景。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"6","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔다는데","audio":"/audio/799024d840be6cef2780.mp3"}},{"text":"그걸","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그걸","audio":"/audio/bf907ef577d38e391ac6.mp3"}},{"text":"보자.","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보자","audio":"/audio/0434c803cb8571c9cf8e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"18d20ab9ca6f98fa","term":"코미디","zh":"喜剧","audio":"/audio/18d20ab9ca6f98fa4d84.mp3","entryId":"28153","definition":"诙谐搞笑情节的戏剧或电视剧。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看